{"model":"deepseek-r1:7b","created_at":"2025-09-19T06:33:22.65491Z","response":"\u003cthink\u003e\nI need to calculate the product of 37 and 29. To make this easier, I'll use the distributive property by breaking down the numbers.\n\nFirst, I'll break 29 into 20 and 9. Then, I'll multiply each part separately by 37.\n\nMultiplying 37 by 20 gives me 740.\nNext, multiplying 37 by 9 results in 333.\n\nFinally, I'll add these two partial products together: 740 plus 333 equals 1073.\n\u003c/think\u003e\n\nTo calculate \\( 37 \\times 29 \\), we can use the distributive property:\n\n\\[\n37 \\times 29 = (30 + 7) \\times 29 = (30 \\times 29) + (7 \\times 29)\n\\]\n\nNow, compute each part separately:\n\n1. \\( 30 \\times 29 = 870 \\)\n2. \\( 7 \\times 29 = 203 \\)\n\nFinally, add the two results together:\n\n\\[\n870 + 203 = 1073\n\\]\n\nSo,\n\n\\[\n37 \\times 29 = \\boxed{1073}\n\\]","done":true,"done_reason":"stop","context":[151644,2610,525,264,16585,11,46899,2874,261,13,5547,3019,553,3019,448,11464,28439,32711,624,3973,697,1102,28135,1573,1590,4849,13,1416,6888,46928,374,6398,11,10146,432,73045,382,8973,46817,25,3972,448,6896,825,1555,510,19357,21806,25,366,603,1555,1172,1339,14582,510,3838,374,220,18,22,9,17,24,30,6928,697,975,624,151645,151648,198,40,1184,311,11047,279,1985,315,220,18,22,323,220,17,24,13,2014,1281,419,8661,11,358,3278,990,279,2846,6704,3343,553,14719,1495,279,5109,382,5338,11,358,3278,1438,220,17,24,1119,220,17,15,323,220,24,13,5005,11,358,3278,30270,1817,949,25156,553,220,18,22,382,57251,6711,220,18,22,553,220,17,15,6696,752,220,22,19,15,624,5847,11,84192,220,18,22,553,220,24,3059,304,220,18,18,18,382,23949,11,358,3278,912,1493,1378,7130,3871,3786,25,220,22,19,15,5519,220,18,18,18,16819,220,16,15,22,18,624,151649,271,1249,11047,17767,220,18,22,1124,15136,220,17,24,1124,701,582,646,990,279,2846,6704,3343,1447,59,9640,18,22,1124,15136,220,17,24,284,320,18,15,488,220,22,8,1124,15136,220,17,24,284,320,18,15,1124,15136,220,17,24,8,488,320,22,1124,15136,22